{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Header.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Absurd and over-the-top arcade sports where powers shake up the match every time your opponent scores.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score a goal? Your opponent picks a game-changing power-up.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From small tweaks to turning a match on its head, these powers turn footy into a constantly evolving, unpredictable battle.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outplay, outkick, and out-jank your mates in local multiplayer or conquer singleplayer season mode.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PieThin.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AUSTRALIAN RULES FOOTBALL LIKE YOU'VE NEVER SEEN IT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Australia, everyone knows Aussie Rules refers to Australian Rules Football. It\u2019s the largest sport in Australia and the most attended domestic sports league in the world. Even non-sports fans have a rough idea of how it works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But for those outside the loop, \u201cAussie Rules\u201d could mean... well, anything.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to catch the ball with a deadly animal in your shoe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is best played whilst surfing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you score a goal, you have to drink a billion beers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You score points by getting the ball in a Kangaroo\u2019s pouch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pro Jank Footy takes this confusion and runs with it\u2014a fast-paced, comedic sports game where the rules are always changing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PieThin_Flipped.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WORLD CLASS COMEDY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With commentating from <strong>Aunty Donna's Broden Kelly</strong> and the creative minds of\u00a0<strong>David Ashby</strong> and<strong> Dario Russo</strong> behind cult TV series <strong>Danger 5</strong> and <strong>Italian Spiderman</strong> driving the humor, Pro Jank Footy is jam-packed with comedy, charm and Australianisms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1v1 &amp; 2v2 MODES</strong> \u2013 Face off against AI or challenge your mates in couch co-op and online play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_1.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ROGUELITE GAMEPLAY</strong> \u2013 Every goal scored lets your opponent choose from over <strong>200+ ridiculous power-ups</strong> that completely alter the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_2.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEASON MODE</strong> \u2013 Lead your team through a <strong>full premiership season</strong> with deck-building mechanics to unlock and customize power-ups as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_3.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RETRO ARCADE NOSTALGIA</strong> \u2013 Inspired by  classic 90s sports games, blending pixel-perfect action with buttery-smooth modern gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_4.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNIQUELY AUSTRALIAN</strong> \u2013 Aussie Rules meets Aussie humor. <strong>It\u2019s chaotic, unpredictable, and proudly embraces the great Australian tradition of talking absolute nonsense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_Cards_5.png?t=1744169633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>MULTIPLE TEAMS &amp; STADIUMS</strong> \u2013 Play as <strong>12 unique teams</strong> across <strong>8 iconic stadiums</strong>, each with their own quirks, hazards, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/extras/PRJ_DescSeparator_MrFooty.png?t=1744169633\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621330?t=1744169633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621330?t=1744169633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/42a7a8f0ebb43854befa7512408bc4459aa24faa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744169633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621330/42a7a8f0ebb43854befa7512408bc4459aa24faa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744169633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Share