.jpg?t=1744169633"}],"short_description":"Pro Jank Footy is an over-the-top, retro-inspired arcade comedy-sports game where every goal unleashes chaos. With power-ups, fast-paced footy action, and absurd physics-based mayhem, no two matches are ever the same.","steam_appid":3621330,"support_info":{"email":"hello@powerbomb.com.au","url":"https://www.powerbomb.com.au/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.powerbomb.com.au/"}